# Docker 相关文件忽略规则

# ============ 初始化数据 ============
# 忽略实际的数据文件，但保留目录结构

# MongoDB 初始化数据
mongodb/initdata/*.bson
mongodb/initdata/*.json
!mongodb/initdata/.gitkeep
!mongodb/initdata/README.md

# MariaDB 初始化数据
mariadb/init/*.sql
mariadb/init/*.sh
!mariadb/init/.gitkeep
!mariadb/init/README.md

# 旧的初始化数据路径（如果还存在）
initdata/

# ============ 日志文件 ============
*.log

# ============ 临时文件 ============
*.tmp
*.temp
.DS_Store

# ============ SSL 证书 ============
ssl/*.pem
ssl/*.key
ssl/*.crt
!ssl/.gitkeep

# ============ 备份文件 ============
*.backup
*.bak

